1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,960
My glory doesn't happen in front of a crowd, it doesn't happen in a stadium or on a stage.

2
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:11,700
There are no medals handed out.

3
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:20,000
It happens in the darkness of the early morning, in solitude, where I try and I try and I try

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,280
again with everything I have to be the best that I can possibly be, better than I was

5
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:35,119
yesterday, better than people thought I could be, better than I thought I could be and claim

6
00:00:35,119 --> 00:00:43,480
one victory that no one can ever take away from me ever, a victory that is earned every

7
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:53,400
single day, a victory of determination and will and discipline, a victory achieved because

8
00:00:53,400 --> 00:00:56,320
I will not stop.


